 The new training course has been added. This mission contains 6 rooms which are dedicated to different in-game mechanics;
 Daily quests are now available. Complete them to get Cyrium and use it to purchase weapons and upgrades;
 Sandbox mode has been eliminated, however, free roam game modes have been added to skirmish. Every game mode now gives experience;
 The game difficulty now increases with player level;
 Weak spots are added. You can now kill an enemy faster if you aim its head;
 It’s time to beat aliens! You can now stun and kill enemies using ranged weapons in close combat;
 Ai behavior has been upgraded further. We will continue working on it;
 You can now change weapons without removing the current weapon in the slot;
 Respawn time has been reduced;
 It is now easier to take items from a distance;
 Teleportation with increased ping is now fixed.
